DEV enviroment:

terraform apply -var-file=dev.tfvars

poetry run python -m producer.producer
poetry run python -m producer.write_to_s3
poetry run python -m producer.read_iceberg

aws-iceberg-banking-transaction
│
├── terraform/
│   ├── dev.tfvars
│   └── prod.tfvars
│
├── producer/
│
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/
│       ├── terraform-plan.yml
│       ├── deploy-dev.yml
│       └── deploy-prod.yml
│
├── pyproject.toml
└── README.md

======= develop process =========
======= dev branch ==============
feature/*
    ↓
develop
    ↓
GitHub Action
    ↓
terraform apply -var-file=dev.tfvars
    ↓
run tests

======= main branch ==============

develop
    ↓
PR
    ↓
main
    ↓
GitHub Action
    ↓
terraform apply -var-file=prod.tfvars
    ↓
deploy prod


如果手动删除了warehouse， 则需要再单独删除glue database
aws glue delete-table \
  --database-name transaction_db_dev \
  --name transaction_logs